# NOTE: ai_ml/scrapers is NOT excluded. It was, which meant scrape_audio
# shipped in no image even once its imports were fixed. The scraper is gated
# at runtime by SCRAPER_ENABLED (see settings.py); shipping the code is not
# the same as running it.
# NOTE: wheelhouse/ MUST stay in the build context — the Dockerfile COPYs it.

